size 16 16
// Mistcap Morsel (Bloommantis + Reedmantis treat): a pale-blue mistcap wrapped in an umbrella-fern leaf.
gradramp cap 8 #1a3a5a #2a5a84 #4a86b0 #7ab4d4 #b0dcee #e8f8ff
gradramp leaf 6 #0e2a12 #1a4a1e #2a6a2a #44903a #6cb050
layer leaf
key L #2a6a2a
grid 0 0
