..LL.......LL...
...LLL...LLL....
...LLLLLLLLL....
....LLLLLLL.....
.....LLLLL......
................
................
................
end
shade leaf light=-1,-1 depth=2 contrast=0.6 base=0.5
line 4 10 7 12 leaf.0
layer cap
key C #7ab4d4
grid 0 0
